\p \v 14 \w So he said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w These|strong="H00428"\w* \w are the two|strong="H08147"\w* \w anointed|strong="H03323"\w* \w ones|strong="H01121"\w*\f + \fr 4:14 \ft Hebrew \fqa the two sons of new oil\f* \w who are standing|strong="H05975"\w* \w beside|strong="H05921"\w* \w the Lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w*.”\f + \fr 4:14 \ft See Revelation 11:4.\f*
\c 5
\s1 The Vision of the Flying Scroll
\p \v 1 \w Again|strong="H07725"\w* \w I lifted up|strong="H05375"\w* \w my eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w and saw|strong="H07200"\w* \w before me|strong="H02009"\w* \w a flying|strong="H05774"\w* \w scroll|strong="H04039"\w*.
\p \v 2 “\w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w do you|strong="H00859"\w* \w see|strong="H07200"\w*?” \w asked [the angel]|strong="H00559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w*.
\p “\w I|strong="H00589"\w* \w see|strong="H07200"\w* \w a flying|strong="H05774"\w* \w scroll|strong="H04039"\w*,” \w I replied|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w twenty|strong="H06242"\w* \w cubits|strong="H00520"\w* \w long|strong="H00753"\w* \w and ten|strong="H06235"\w* \w cubits|strong="H00520"\w* \w wide|strong="H07341"\w*.\f + \fr 5:2 \ft The flying scroll was approximately 30 feet long and 15 feet wide (9.1 meters long and 4.6 meters wide).\f*”
\p \v 3 \w Then he told|strong="H00559"\w* \w me|strong="H00413"\w*, “\w This|strong="H02063"\w* \w is the curse|strong="H00423"\w* \w that is going out|strong="H03318"\w* \w over|strong="H05921"\w* \w the face|strong="H06440"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w according [to]|strong="H03644"\w* \w one [side] of [the scroll]|strong="H02088"\w*, \w every|strong="H03605"\w* \w thief|strong="H01589"\w* \w will be removed|strong="H05352"\w*; \w and according to|strong="H03644"\w* \w the other side|strong="H02088"\w*, \w every|strong="H03605"\w* \w perjurer|strong="H07650"\w* \w will be removed|strong="H05352"\w*. \v 4 \w I will send it out|strong="H03318"\w*, \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*, \w and it will enter|strong="H00935"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of the thief|strong="H01590"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w and the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of him who swears|strong="H07650"\w* \w falsely|strong="H08267"\w* \w by My name|strong="H08034"\w*. \w It will remain|strong="H03885"\w* \w inside|strong="H08432"\w* \w his house|strong="H01004"\w* \w and destroy it|strong="H03615"\w*, \w [down to]|strong="H00853"\w* \w its timbers|strong="H06086"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and stones|strong="H00068"\w*.”
\s1 The Vision of the Woman in a Basket
\p \v 5 \w Then the angel|strong="H04397"\w* \w who was speaking|strong="H01696"\w* with me \w came forward|strong="H03318"\w* \w and told|strong="H00559"\w* \w me|strong="H00413"\w*, “\w Now|strong="H04994"\w* \w lift up|strong="H05375"\w* \w your eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w and see|strong="H07200"\w* \w what|strong="H04100"\w* \w -|strong="H02063"\w* \w is approaching|strong="H03318"\w*.”
\p \v 6 “\w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w is it|strong="H01931"\w*?” \w I asked|strong="H00559"\w*.
\p \w And he replied|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w -|strong="H02063"\w* \w A measuring basket|strong="H00374"\w*\f + \fr 5:6 \ft Or \fqa An ephah\f* \w is going forth|strong="H03318"\w*.” \w Then he continued|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w This|strong="H02063"\w* \w is their iniquity|strong="H05869"\w*\f + \fr 5:6 \ft One Hebrew manuscript, LXX, and Syriac; most Hebrew manuscripts \fqa their appearance \ft or (literally) \fqa their eye\f* \w in all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*.”
\p \v 7 \w And behold|strong="H02009"\w*, \w the cover|strong="H03603"\w* \w of lead|strong="H05777"\w* \w was raised|strong="H05375"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H02063"\w* \w and there was|strong="H00259"\w* \w a woman|strong="H00802"\w* \w sitting|strong="H03427"\w* \w inside|strong="H08432"\w* \w the basket|strong="H00374"\w*.
\p \v 8 “\w This|strong="H02063"\w* \w is Wickedness|strong="H07564"\w*,” \w he said|strong="H00559"\w*. \w And he shoved her down|strong="H07993"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w into|strong="H00413"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08432"\w* \w the basket|strong="H00374"\w*, \w pushing down|strong="H07993"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the lead|strong="H05777"\w* \w cover|strong="H00068"\w* \w over|strong="H00413"\w* \w its opening|strong="H06310"\w*.
\p \v 9 \w Then I lifted|strong="H05375"\w* \w up my eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w and saw|strong="H07200"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02009"\w* \w two|strong="H08147"\w* \w women|strong="H00802"\w* \w approaching|strong="H03318"\w*, \w with the wind|strong="H07307"\w* \w in their wings|strong="H03671"\w*. Their \w wings|strong="H03671"\w* \w were like those|strong="H03671"\w* \w of a stork|strong="H02624"\w*, \w and they lifted up|strong="H05375"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the basket|strong="H00374"\w* \w between|strong="H00996"\w* \w heaven|strong="H08064"\w* \w and|strong="H00996"\w* \w earth|strong="H00776"\w*.
\p \v 10 “\w Where|strong="H00575"\w* \w are they|strong="H01992"\w* \w taking|strong="H01980"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the basket|strong="H00374"\w*?” \w I asked|strong="H00559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w the angel|strong="H04397"\w* \w who was speaking|strong="H01696"\w* with me.
\p \v 11 “\w To build|strong="H01129"\w* \w a house|strong="H01004"\w* for it \w in the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of Shinar|strong="H08152"\w*,\f + \fr 5:11 \ft That is, Babylonia\f*” \w he told|strong="H00559"\w* \w me|strong="H00413"\w*. “\w And when it is ready|strong="H03559"\w*, \w the basket will be set|strong="H05117"\w* \w there|strong="H08033"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w its pedestal|strong="H04369"\w*.”
\c 6
\s1 The Vision of the Four Chariots
\p \v 1 \w And again|strong="H07725"\w* \w I lifted|strong="H05375"\w* \w up my eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w and saw|strong="H07200"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02009"\w* \w four|strong="H00702"\w* \w chariots|strong="H04818"\w* \w coming out|strong="H03318"\w* \w from between|strong="H00996"\w* \w two|strong="H08147"\w* \w mountains|strong="H02022"\w* — \w mountains|strong="H02022"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02022"\w* \w of bronze|strong="H05178"\w*. \v 2 \w The first|strong="H07223"\w* \w chariot|strong="H04818"\w* \w had red|strong="H00122"\w* \w horses|strong="H05483"\w*, \w the second|strong="H08145"\w* \w -|strong="H04818"\w* \w black|strong="H07838"\w* \w horses|strong="H05483"\w*, \v 3 \w the third|strong="H07992"\w* \w -|strong="H04818"\w* \w white|strong="H03836"\w* \w horses|strong="H05483"\w*, \w and the fourth|strong="H07243"\w* \w -|strong="H04818"\w* \w dappled|strong="H01261"\w* \w horses|strong="H05483"\w*— \w all of them strong|strong="H00554"\w*.
\p \v 4 \w -|strong="H06030"\w* \w So I inquired|strong="H00559"\w* \w of|strong="H00413"\w* \w the angel|strong="H04397"\w* \w who was speaking|strong="H01696"\w* with me, “\w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w are these|strong="H00428"\w*, \w my lord|strong="H00113"\w*?”
\p \v 5 \w And|strong="H06030"\w* \w the angel|strong="H04397"\w* \w told|strong="H00559"\w* \w me|strong="H00413"\w*, “\w These|strong="H00428"\w* \w are the four|strong="H00702"\w* \w spirits|strong="H07307"\w*\f + \fr 6:5 \ft Or \fqa winds\f* \w of heaven|strong="H08064"\w*, \w going forth|strong="H03318"\w* \w from [their] station|strong="H03320"\w* \w before|strong="H05921"\w* \w the Lord|strong="H00113"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w*. \v 6 \w The one|strong="H00834"\w* with \w the black|strong="H07838"\w* \w horses|strong="H05483"\w* \w is going|strong="H03318"\w* \w toward|strong="H00413"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of the north|strong="H06828"\w*, \w [the one with] the white [horses]|strong="H03836"\w* \w -|strong="H03318"\w* \w toward|strong="H00413"\w* \w [the west]|strong="H00310"\w*,\f + \fr 6:6 \ft Or \fqa the one with the white horses after them\f* \w and [the one with] the dappled [horses]|strong="H01261"\w* \w -|strong="H03318"\w* \w toward|strong="H00413"\w* \w -|strong="H00776"\w* \w the south|strong="H08486"\w*.”
\p \v 7 \w As the strong [horses]|strong="H00554"\w* \w went out|strong="H03318"\w*, \w they were eager|strong="H01245"\w* \w to go|strong="H01980"\w* \w [and] patrol|strong="H01980"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w*; \w and [the LORD] said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Go|strong="H01980"\w* \w [and] patrol|strong="H01980"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w*.” \w So they patrolled|strong="H01980"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w*.
\p \v 8 \w Then [the LORD] summoned|strong="H02199"\w* \w me|strong="H00854"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01696"\w* \w and said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Behold|strong="H07200"\w*, \w those going|strong="H03318"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of the north|strong="H06828"\w* \w have given rest|strong="H05117"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w to My Spirit|strong="H07307"\w* \w in the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of the north|strong="H06828"\w*.”
\s1 The Crown and the Temple
\p \v 9 \w The word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w also came|strong="H01961"\w* \w to me|strong="H00413"\w*, \w saying|strong="H00559"\w*, \v 10 “\w Take|strong="H03947"\w* \w an offering from|strong="H00854"\w* \w the exiles|strong="H01473"\w* — \w from Heldai|strong="H02469"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H00854"\w* \w Tobijah|strong="H02900"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H00854"\w* \w and Jedaiah|strong="H03048"\w*, \w who|strong="H00834"\w* \w have arrived|strong="H00935"\w* \w from Babylon|strong="H00894"\w* — \w and go|strong="H00935"\w*\w . . .|strong="H00859"\w*\w . . .|strong="H00935"\w* \w that same|strong="H01931"\w* \w day|strong="H03117"\w* \w to the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of Josiah|strong="H02977"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Zephaniah|strong="H06846"\w*. \v 11 \w Take|strong="H03947"\w* \w silver|strong="H03701"\w* \w and gold|strong="H02091"\w*, \w make|strong="H06213"\w* \w an [ornate] crown|strong="H05850"\w*, \w and set|strong="H07760"\w* \w [it] on the head|strong="H07218"\w* \w of the high|strong="H01419"\w* \w priest|strong="H03548"\w*, \w Joshua|strong="H03091"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Jehozadak|strong="H03087"\w*.\f + \fr 6:11 \fqa Jehozadak \ft is a variant of \fqa Jozadak\ft ; see Ezra 3:2.\f*
\p \v 12 \w And you are to tell him|strong="H00559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w*\w . . .|strong="H00559"\w* \w that this is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: ‘\w Here is|strong="H02009"\w* \w a man|strong="H00376"\w* \w whose name [is]|strong="H08034"\w* \w the Branch|strong="H06780"\w*, \w and He will branch out|strong="H06779"\w* \w from His place|strong="H08478"\w* \w and build|strong="H01129"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the temple|strong="H01964"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*. \v 13 \w Yes, He|strong="H01931"\w* \w will build|strong="H01129"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the temple|strong="H01964"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*; \w He|strong="H01931"\w* \w will be clothed in|strong="H05375"\w* \w splendor|strong="H01935"\w* \w and will sit|strong="H03427"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w His throne|strong="H03678"\w* \w and rule|strong="H04910"\w*. \w And He will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w a priest|strong="H03548"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w His throne|strong="H03678"\w*,\f + \fr 6:13 \ft Or \fqa And there will be a priest on His throne\f* \w and there will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w peaceful|strong="H07965"\w* \w counsel|strong="H06098"\w* \w between|strong="H00996"\w* \w the two|strong="H08147"\w*.’
\p \v 14 \w The crown|strong="H05850"\w* \w will reside|strong="H01961"\w* \w in the temple|strong="H01964"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w as a memorial|strong="H02146"\w* \w to Helem|strong="H02494"\w*,\f + \fr 6:14 \ft Hebrew; Syriac \fqa Heldai\ft ; see verse 10.\f* \w Tobijah|strong="H02900"\w*, \w Jedaiah|strong="H03048"\w*, \w and the gracious|strong="H02581"\w*\f + \fr 6:14 \ft Or \fqa and Hen\ft ; Syriac \fqa and Josiah\ft ; see verse 10.\f* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Zephaniah|strong="H06846"\w*. \v 15 \w Even those far away|strong="H07350"\w* \w will come|strong="H00935"\w* \w and build|strong="H01129"\w* \w the temple|strong="H01964"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, \w and you will know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w has sent Me|strong="H07971"\w* \w to you|strong="H00413"\w*. \w This will happen|strong="H01961"\w* \w if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you diligently obey|strong="H08085"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08085"\w* \w the voice|strong="H06963"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w*.”
\c 7
\s1 A Call to Justice and Mercy
\p \v 1 \w In the fourth|strong="H00702"\w* \w year|strong="H08141"\w* \w of King|strong="H04428"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01961"\w* \w Darius|strong="H01867"\w*, \w the word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w came|strong="H01961"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Zechariah|strong="H02148"\w* \w on the fourth|strong="H00702"\w* \w day of the ninth|strong="H08671"\w* \w month|strong="H02320"\w*, \w the month of Chislev|strong="H03691"\w*.\f + \fr 7:1 \fqa Chislev \ft is the ninth month of the Hebrew lunar calendar, usually occurring within the months of November and December.\f* \v 2 \w vvv|strong="H01008"\w* \w Now the people of Bethel|strong="H01008"\w* \w had sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w vvv|strong="H08272"\w* \w Sharezer|strong="H08272"\w* \w vvv|strong="H07278"\w* \w and Regem-melech|strong="H07278"\w*, \w along with their men|strong="H00582"\w*,\f + \fr 7:2 \ft Or \fqa Bethel-sharezer had sent Regem-melech, along with his men,\f* \w to plead|strong="H02470"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \v 3 \w by asking|strong="H00559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w of the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*, \w as well as|strong="H00413"\w* \w the prophets|strong="H05030"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Should I weep|strong="H01058"\w* \w and fast|strong="H05144"\w* \w in the fifth|strong="H02549"\w* \w month|strong="H02320"\w*, \w as|strong="H00834"\w* \w I have done|strong="H06213"\w* \w these|strong="H02088"\w* \w many|strong="H04100"\w* \w years|strong="H08141"\w*?”
\p \v 4 \w Then the word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w came|strong="H01961"\w* \w to me|strong="H00413"\w*, \w saying|strong="H00559"\w*, \v 5 “\w Ask|strong="H00559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w of the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w and the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w When|strong="H03588"\w* \w you fasted|strong="H06684"\w* \w and mourned|strong="H05594"\w* \w in the fifth|strong="H02549"\w* \w and seventh months|strong="H07637"\w* \w for these|strong="H02088"\w* \w seventy|strong="H07657"\w* \w years|strong="H08141"\w*, \w {was it really} for Me|strong="H00589"\w* \w that you fasted|strong="H06684"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06684"\w*? \v 6 \w And when|strong="H03588"\w* \w you were eating|strong="H00398"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03588"\w* \w and drinking|strong="H08354"\w*, \w were you not|strong="H03808"\w* \w [doing so]|strong="H00859"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00398"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00859"\w* \w simply for yourselves|strong="H08354"\w*? \v 7 \w Are these not|strong="H03808"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the words|strong="H01697"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w proclaimed|strong="H07121"\w* \w through|strong="H03027"\w* \w the earlier|strong="H07223"\w* \w prophets|strong="H05030"\w*, \w when Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w* \w and its surrounding|strong="H05439"\w* \w towns|strong="H05892"\w* \w were|strong="H01961"\w* \w populous|strong="H03427"\w* \w and prosperous|strong="H07961"\w*, \w and the Negev|strong="H05045"\w* \w and the foothills|strong="H08219"\w*\f + \fr 7:7 \ft Hebrew \fqa Shephelah \ft or \fqa lowlands\ft ; that is, the western foothills of Judea\f* \w were inhabited|strong="H03427"\w*?’”
\p \v 8 \w Then the word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w came|strong="H01961"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Zechariah|strong="H02148"\w*, \w saying|strong="H00559"\w*, \v 9 “\w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00559"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: ‘\w Administer|strong="H08199"\w* \w true|strong="H00571"\w* \w justice|strong="H04941"\w*. \w Show|strong="H06213"\w* \w loving devotion|strong="H02617"\w*\f + \fr 7:9 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa chesed \ft are translated here and in most cases throughout the Scriptures as \fqa loving devotion\ft ; the range of meaning includes \fqa love\ft , \fqa goodness\ft , \fqa kindness\ft , \fqa faithfulness\ft , and \fqa mercy\ft , as well as \fqa loyalty to a covenant\ft .\f* \w and compassion|strong="H07356"\w* \w to|strong="H00854"\w* \w one|strong="H00376"\w* \w another|strong="H00251"\w*. \v 10 \w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w oppress|strong="H06231"\w* \w the widow|strong="H00490"\w* \w or the fatherless|strong="H03490"\w*, \w the foreigner|strong="H01616"\w* \w or the poor|strong="H06041"\w*. \w And do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w plot|strong="H02803"\w* \w evil|strong="H07451"\w* \w in your hearts|strong="H03824"\w* \w against one|strong="H00376"\w* \w another|strong="H00251"\w*.’
\p \v 11 \w But they refused|strong="H03985"\w* \w to pay attention|strong="H07181"\w* \w and turned|strong="H05414"\w* \w a stubborn|strong="H05637"\w* \w shoulder|strong="H03802"\w*; \w they stopped up|strong="H03513"\w* \w their ears|strong="H00241"\w* \w from hearing|strong="H08085"\w*.\f + \fr 7:11 \ft Hebrew \fqa they made their ears too heavy to hear\f* \v 12 \w They made|strong="H07760"\w* \w their hearts|strong="H03820"\w* \w [like] flint|strong="H08068"\w* \w and would not listen to|strong="H08085"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the law|strong="H08451"\w* \w or|strong="H00853"\w* \w to the words|strong="H01697"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w had sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w by His Spirit|strong="H07307"\w* \w through|strong="H03027"\w* \w the earlier|strong="H07223"\w* \w prophets|strong="H05030"\w*. \w Therefore great|strong="H01419"\w* \w anger|strong="H07110"\w* \w came|strong="H01961"\w* \w from|strong="H00854"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*.
\p \v 13 \w And|strong="H01961"\w* \w just as|strong="H00834"\w* \w I had called|strong="H07121"\w* \w and they would not|strong="H03808"\w* \w listen|strong="H08085"\w*, \w so|strong="H03651"\w* \w when they called|strong="H07121"\w* \w I would not|strong="H03808"\w* \w listen|strong="H08085"\w*, \w says|strong="H00559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*. \v 14 \w But I scattered them with a whirlwind|strong="H05590"\w* \w among|strong="H05921"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the nations|strong="H01471"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w they had not|strong="H03808"\w* \w known|strong="H03045"\w*, \w and the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w was left desolate|strong="H08074"\w* \w behind them|strong="H00310"\w* \w so that no one could come|strong="H05674"\w* \w or go|strong="H07725"\w*. \w Thus they turned|strong="H07760"\w* \w the pleasant|strong="H02532"\w* \w land|strong="H00776"\w* \w into a desolation|strong="H08047"\w*.”
\c 8
\s1 The Restoration of Jerusalem
\r (Micah 4:6–13)
\p \v 1 \w Again the word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w came [to me]|strong="H01961"\w*, \w saying|strong="H00559"\w*: \v 2 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: “\w I am jealous|strong="H07065"\w* \w for Zion|strong="H06726"\w* \w with great|strong="H01419"\w* \w zeal|strong="H07068"\w*; \w I am jealous|strong="H07065"\w* for her \w with great|strong="H01419"\w* \w fervor|strong="H02534"\w*.”
\p \v 3 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: “\w I will return|strong="H07725"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Zion|strong="H06726"\w* \w and dwell|strong="H07931"\w* \w in|strong="H08432"\w* \w Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w*. \w Then Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w* \w will be called|strong="H07121"\w* \w the City|strong="H05892"\w* \w of Truth|strong="H00571"\w*, \w and the mountain|strong="H02022"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w [will be called] the Holy|strong="H06944"\w* \w Mountain|strong="H02022"\w*.”
\p \v 4 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: “\w Old men|strong="H02205"\w* \w and old women|strong="H02205"\w* \w will again|strong="H05750"\w* \w sit|strong="H03427"\w* \w along the streets|strong="H07339"\w* \w of Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w*, \w each|strong="H00376"\w* \w with a staff|strong="H04938"\w* \w in hand|strong="H03027"\w* \w because of|strong="H07230"\w* \w great age|strong="H03117"\w*. \v 5 \w And the streets|strong="H07339"\w* \w of the city|strong="H05892"\w* \w will be filled|strong="H04390"\w* \w with boys|strong="H03206"\w* \w and girls|strong="H03207"\w* \w playing|strong="H07832"\w* \w there|strong="H07339"\w*.”
\p \v 6 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: “\w If|strong="H03588"\w* \w [this] is impossible|strong="H06381"\w*\f + \fr 8:6 \ft Or \fqa marvelous\ft ; twice in this verse\f* \w in the eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w of the remnant|strong="H07611"\w* \w of this|strong="H02088"\w* \w people|strong="H05971"\w* \w in these|strong="H01992"\w* \w days|strong="H03117"\w*, \w should it also|strong="H01571"\w* \w be impossible|strong="H06381"\w* \w in My eyes|strong="H05869"\w*?” \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*.
\p \v 7 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02005"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: “\w I will save|strong="H03467"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w My people|strong="H05971"\w* \w from the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of the east|strong="H04217"\w* \w and from the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of|strong="H03996"\w* \w the west|strong="H08121"\w*. \v 8 \w I will bring them|strong="H00935"\w* \w {back}|strong="H00853"\w* \w to dwell|strong="H07931"\w* \w in|strong="H08432"\w* \w Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w*, \w where they will be|strong="H01961"\w* My \w people|strong="H05971"\w*, \w and I|strong="H00589"\w* \w will be|strong="H01961"\w* their \w faithful|strong="H00571"\w* \w and righteous|strong="H06666"\w* \w God|strong="H00430"\w*.”
\p \v 9 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: “\w Let your hands|strong="H03027"\w* \w be strong|strong="H02388"\w*, \w you who now|strong="H03117"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00428"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w hear|strong="H08085"\w* \w these|strong="H00428"\w* \w words|strong="H01697"\w* \w spoken|strong="H00834"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06310"\w* \w by the prophets|strong="H05030"\w* \w [who were present] when|strong="H03117"\w* \w the foundations were laid|strong="H03245"\w* \w to rebuild|strong="H01129"\w* \w the temple|strong="H01964"\w*, \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*. \v 10 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w those|strong="H01992"\w* \w days|strong="H03117"\w* \w neither|strong="H03808"\w* \w man|strong="H00120"\w* \w nor|strong="H00369"\w* \w beast|strong="H00929"\w* \w received|strong="H01961"\w* \w . . .|strong="H07939"\w* \w wages|strong="H07939"\w*, \w nor was there|strong="H00369"\w* \w safety|strong="H07965"\w* \w from|strong="H04480"\w* \w the enemy|strong="H06862"\w* \w for anyone who came|strong="H03318"\w* \w or went|strong="H00935"\w*, \w for I had turned|strong="H07971"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w every|strong="H03605"\w* \w man|strong="H00120"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00376"\w* \w against his neighbor|strong="H07453"\w*. \v 11 \w But now|strong="H06258"\w* \w I|strong="H00589"\w* \w will not treat|strong="H03808"\w* \w the remnant|strong="H07611"\w* \w of this|strong="H02088"\w* \w people|strong="H05971"\w* \w as I did in the past|strong="H07223"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03117"\w*,” \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*.
\p \v 12 “\w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w the seed|strong="H02233"\w* \w [will be] prosperous|strong="H07965"\w*, \w the vine|strong="H01612"\w* \w will yield|strong="H05414"\w* \w its fruit|strong="H06529"\w*, \w the ground|strong="H00776"\w* \w will yield|strong="H05414"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w its produce|strong="H02981"\w*, \w and the skies|strong="H08064"\w* \w will give|strong="H05414"\w* \w their dew|strong="H02919"\w*. \w To the remnant|strong="H07611"\w* \w of this|strong="H02088"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w people|strong="H05971"\w* \w {I will give} all|strong="H03605"\w* \w these things|strong="H00428"\w* \w as an inheritance|strong="H05157"\w*. \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \v 13 \w As|strong="H00834"\w* \w vvv|strong="H01961"\w* \w you have been|strong="H01961"\w* \w a curse|strong="H07045"\w* \w among the nations|strong="H01471"\w*, \w O house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w and house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w so|strong="H03651"\w* \w I will save|strong="H03467"\w* \w you|strong="H00853"\w*, \w and you will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w a blessing|strong="H01293"\w*. \w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w be afraid|strong="H03372"\w*; \w let your hands|strong="H03027"\w* \w be strong|strong="H02388"\w*.”
\p \v 14 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*: “\w Just as|strong="H00834"\w* \w I resolved|strong="H02161"\w* \w to bring disaster|strong="H07489"\w* upon you \w when your fathers|strong="H00001"\w* \w provoked Me to anger|strong="H07107"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w*, \w and I did not|strong="H03808"\w* \w relent|strong="H05162"\w*,” \w says|strong="H00559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*, \v 15 “\w so|strong="H03651"\w* \w now|strong="H00428"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03117"\w* \w I have resolved|strong="H02161"\w* \w to do good|strong="H03190"\w* \w again|strong="H07725"\w*\w . . .|strong="H00853"\w* \w to Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w vvv|strong="H01004"\w* \w Judah|strong="H03063"\w*. \w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w be afraid|strong="H03372"\w*. \v 16 \w These|strong="H00428"\w* \w are the things|strong="H01697"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w you must do|strong="H06213"\w*: \w Speak|strong="H01696"\w* \w truth|strong="H00571"\w* \w to one|strong="H00376"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00854"\w* \w another|strong="H07453"\w*, \w render true|strong="H00571"\w* \w and sound|strong="H07965"\w* \w judgments|strong="H04941"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08199"\w* \w in your gates|strong="H08179"\w*, \v 17 \w -|strong="H00376"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w plot|strong="H02803"\w* \w evil|strong="H07451"\w* \w in your hearts|strong="H03824"\w* \w against your neighbor|strong="H07453"\w*, \w and do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w love|strong="H00157"\w* \w to swear|strong="H07621"\w* \w falsely|strong="H08267"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w I hate|strong="H08130"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w these things|strong="H00428"\w*,” \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*.
